        "guide_todo_td_17": "Delete",































































































































        "guide_todo_td_2": "Click the \"+ Add\" button to create an item. You can set a title, description, and priority (LOW / MEDIUM / HIGH / URGENT)",































































































































        "guide_todo_td_3": "Assign Bot",































































































































        "guide_todo_td_4": "Each TODO can be assigned to a specific Entity (e.g., Entity 0, Entity 1) or multiple Entities at once",































































































































        "guide_todo_td_5": "Start Mission",































































































































        "guide_todo_td_6": "Move the TODO to the \"Mission List\" (status changes to IN_PROGRESS)",































































































































