        "guide_agentcard_h2_howto": "How to Configure",































































































































        "guide_agentcard_h3_web": "Web Portal Method",































































































































        "guide_agentcard_web_li1": "Go to the <strong>Dashboard</strong> page",































































































































        "guide_agentcard_web_li2": "Select the entity card to configure",































































































































