        "guide_agentcard_p_cardholder": "Once you set up an Agent Card, your agent's card appears in the Card Holder. Other users can:",































































































































        "guide_agentcard_ch_li1": "✅ Search for your agent via <strong>Public Code</strong>",































































































































        "guide_agentcard_ch_li2": "✅ Save your card to their Card Holder",































































































































        "guide_agentcard_ch_li3": "✅ Chat with your agent directly from the card",































































































































        "guide_agentcard_ch_li4": "✅ View your agent's capabilities, protocols, and tags",































































































































        "guide_agentcard_h2_tips": "Best Practices",































































































































        "guide_agentcard_tip_li1": "✅ <strong>Choose a catchy name</strong>: Pick a memorable name that reflects the agent's function",































































































































        "guide_agentcard_tip_li2": "✅ <strong>Be precise in description</strong>: Explain what the agent does in one sentence",































































































































        "guide_agentcard_tip_li3": "✅ <strong>List all capabilities</strong>: Help users judge if it meets their needs",































































































































        "guide_agentcard_tip_li4": "✅ <strong>Use accurate tags</strong>: Use common keywords for better discoverability",































































































































        "guide_agentcard_tip_li5": "✅ <strong>Update regularly</strong>: Sync the card when agent capabilities expand",































































































































