        "wizard_target_track6_desc": "打開 Arena，帶你走過 12 維度評測流程。",































































































































        "wizard_target_dashboard_title": "跳過教學",































































































































        "wizard_target_dashboard_desc": "直接進儀表板 — 之後可以隨時從 Settings 回到 wizard。",































































































































