        "guide_remote_meta": "Mission Control &gt; Remote Control <span class=\"mc-label\" style=\"background:rgba(244,67,54,0.15);color:#F44336;\">User Enables / Bot Executes</span>",































































































































        "guide_remote_note_1": "This feature is disabled by default. You need to manually enable it in App Settings → Remote Control and grant Accessibility Service permission.",































































































































        "guide_remote_p_1": "Allows Bots to autonomously control your phone's UI. The Bot reads the screen structure via the <strong>Accessibility Tree</strong> and sends commands such as tap, type, and scroll. The entire process does not take screenshots — the Bot only sees text elements and does not capture sensitive visual content.",































































































































