        "guide_features_gps_list": "🍜 Nearby Food · 🅿️ Parking Search · 👥 Friend Location · 🚕 Ride & Navigate · 🏥 Nearest Hospital",































































































































        "guide_features_gps_scenarios": "Use Cases",































































































































        "guide_features_gps_title": "📍 GPS Location Sharing",































































































































