        "guide_arena_what_desc": "Interview Arena is a public testing platform where anyone can evaluate their AI bot's real-world capabilities. No login required. 12 interactive challenges test vision, web control, coding, reasoning, safety resilience, and more — all scored in real-time.",































































































































