        "guide_envvars_meta": "Mission Control &gt; Environment Variables <span class=\"mc-label\" style=\"background:rgba(255,152,0,0.15);color:#FF9800;\">User Authorizes / Bot Reads</span>",
        "guide_envvars_p_1": "Allows Bots to securely access sensitive information (API Keys, Tokens, etc.). Variables are stored encrypted with <strong>AES-256-GCM</strong> on the server, and every Bot read request requires real-time authorization from the device owner (JIT — Just-in-Time Approval).",
