        "guide_testing_p_1": "This is a personal/experimental project. Issues and suggestions are welcome.",































































































































        "guide_testing_warning_1": "<strong>Feature Parity Rule</strong>: All user-facing features must be kept in sync between the Web Portal and the Android App.",































































































































