        "guide_wp_h2_what": "What is Live Wallpaper?",































































































































        "guide_wp_step1_desc": "Search \"e-claw\" on Google Play and install EClawbot.",































































































































        "guide_wp_step1_title": "Step 1: Download EClawbot Android App",































































































































        "guide_wp_step2_desc": "Open the App, log in with Device ID, select the Bot Entity for wallpaper.",































































































































        "guide_wp_step2_title": "Step 2: Bind Your Bot",































































































































        "guide_wp_step3_desc": "Long-press home → Wallpaper → Live Wallpaper → EClawbot → Apply.",































































































































        "guide_wp_step3_title": "Step 3: Set as Live Wallpaper",































































































































        "guide_wp_step4_desc": "Your home screen shows the Bot\\'s chat interface. New messages appear automatically.",































































































































        "guide_wp_step4_title": "Step 4: Enjoy Your AI Wallpaper",































































































































        "guide_wp_tip_li1": "✅ <strong>Set up proactive pushes</strong>: Bot must send messages actively for wallpaper to feel live",































































































































        "guide_wp_tip_li2": "✅ <strong>Pair with TTS voice</strong>: Wallpaper display + voice readout = double notification",































































































































        "guide_wp_tip_li3": "✅ <strong>Lightweight Soul</strong>: Wallpaper replies should be short and punchy",































































































































        "guide_wp_tip_li4": "⚠️ <strong>Watch battery</strong>: Live wallpaper runs continuously — enable battery saver",































































































































        "guide_gps_setup_step3": "# Step 3: App grants permission and reports lat/lng",































































































































        "guide_gps_setup_step4": "# Step 4: Bot queries GET /api/gps/recommendations for nearby info",































































































































        "guide_gps_setup_step5": "# Step 5: Format response with map links (Google Maps / Apple Maps)",































































































































        "guide_gps_tip1": "📍 <strong>Ask First, Then Locate</strong>: Confirm the user's need before requesting GPS — don't ask for location out of nowhere",































































































































        "guide_gps_tip1_strong": "Ask First, Then Locate",































































































































        "guide_gps_tip2": "🔒 <strong>Privacy Notice</strong>: Explain the purpose before requesting — e.g. \"To recommend nearby restaurants, I need your location\"",































































































































        "guide_gps_tip2_strong": "Privacy Notice",































































































































        "guide_gps_tip3": "📊 <strong>Category Filtering</strong>: Use the categories parameter to only query what's needed — avoid returning too much irrelevant info",































































































































        "guide_gps_tip3_strong": "Category Filtering",































































































































        "guide_gps_tip4": "🗺️ <strong>Include Map Links</strong>: Pair with Google Maps links (<code>https://maps.google.com/?q=lat,lng</code>) for one-tap navigation",































































































































        "guide_gps_tip4_strong": "Include Map Links",































































































































        "guide_gps_tip5": "⏱️ <strong>Cache Location</strong>: Don't re-request GPS every turn — reuse the most recent coordinates within the same conversation",































































































































        "guide_gps_tip5_strong": "Cache Location",































































































































