        "guide_identity_tmpl_li3": "You can still customize <code>role</code>, <code>instructions</code>, etc. to override template defaults",































































































































        "guide_identity_h2_tips": "Best Practices",































































































































        "guide_identity_tip_li1": "✅ <strong>Be specific with roles</strong>: \"E-commerce Support Specialist\" is better than \"Assistant\"",































































































































        "guide_identity_tip_li2": "✅ <strong>Use process-based instructions</strong>: Describe \"when X happens, do Y\" instead of just \"be friendly\"",































































































































